<div id="2026-10-16-nav-wrap-until-phone" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-10-16 — Desktop menu wraps; vertical list is phone-only</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> The hamburger and vertical menu now start only below 640px. Wider than that, including a narrowed desktop window and a tablet, the menu wraps onto extra lines and still opens on hover.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> The 1024px cutoff turned a normal desktop window into the phone menu. Wrapping was the old desktop behaviour and is the one to keep.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>root/static/css/menu-theme.css</code>, <code>root/static/js/sub-menu.js</code>.</p>
</div>
